' Every ACCESS and sharing clause OPEN can carry
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR INPUT ACCESS READ AS #1
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR OUTPUT ACCESS WRITE AS #2
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR RANDOM ACCESS READ WRITE AS #3
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR RANDOM SHARED AS #4
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR RANDOM LOCK READ AS #5
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR RANDOM LOCK WRITE AS #6
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR RANDOM LOCK READ WRITE AS #7
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR RANDOM ACCESS READ LOCK WRITE AS #8
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR BINARY ACCESS WRITE SHARED AS #9
OPEN "T.DAT" FOR APPEND AS #10
OPEN "R", #11, "T.DAT", 128
